      "id": "8288315c245c58e88b7ca946c6a755787371f1d2",
      "message": "\u2728 feat: backups: persist private preparation bindings\n\nSave bounded preparation plans, approvals and exact queued replay through the\nexisting sole-writer Store. Schema 9 preserves previous authority state and\nvalidates complete logical resources before startup recovery writes.\n\nKeep private archive owners ephemeral and require current authorization on\nhistorical reads. Backup jobs permit only queued cancellation; no dispatcher,\nrestore route or live filesystem effect is introduced.\n\nValidation: 444 workspace cases, focused migration/restart regressions, strict\nClippy, contract/repository checks and cached dependency checks pass. Genuine\ncurrent-schema qualification wrappers expect 9; frozen older evidence stays 8.",
